  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 504.06 Project Description. Appendix A of the EAP shall include the following information:\n\n(a) Height of the dam, in feet;\n\n(b) Normal surface area of the impoundment, in acres;\n\n(c) Normal and maximum volume of the impoundment, in acre-feet;\n\n(d) Drainage area upstream of the dam, in acres;\n\n(e) Primary spillway freeboard, in feet; and\n\n(f) Discharge capacity of the dam assuming no manual operations with water level one foot from the top of the dam, in cubic feet per second.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss and moved by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 (formerly Env-Wr 506.06); ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 505.06)",
